<title>UK: Volvo, TWR to develop chassis - paper.</title>
<headline>Volvo, TWR to develop chassis - paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish automotive group AB Volvo will announce that it is putting its chassis development activities into a joint-venture with Britain's TWP engineering consultancy, the Financial Times said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The new company, majority owned by TWR will develop chassis for Volvo's buses and coaches and the first results are expected early next century, the paper said.</p>
<p>TWR, which the paper said has no experience in commercial vehicle engineering, is best known for motor racing activities.</p>
</text>
